  <item>
    <title>Vol.5 此去罡风三万里：30岁的国境线摩托日记</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/651045f65c88d24126b540b4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">651045f65c88d24126b540b4</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 24 Sep 2023 14:21:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>子弹一直是一个神奇的人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>第一次跟他打棒球，他被砸伤了眼睛；在互联网大厂平步青云却突然投身保险行业；常被大家拿来开玩笑，却从来不生气。</span></p><span></span><p><span>就是这么一个人，突然在前几个月独自一人骑着摩托车绕着国境线一路向北。</span></p><span></span><p><span>让人不得不感慨，大事都是看似普通的人干出来的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目中，我跟王妹儿一起来跟子弹好好聊聊他一万公里的见闻。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>子弹的摩托车日记</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrYAR76vHQSLrAdZ1V0pl4curT3s.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>---------------------------</span></p><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span>偶遇00后三人组</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp1NKKzYoUKUpEQSjDZJyAAWcOu-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>---------------------------</span></p><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span>在希夏邦马峰露营</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjyOOJXoj4YzsOyaH6LHS8ER9RQA.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>---------------------------</span></p><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span>路过喜马拉雅群峰</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp2CNVkiKBlq9W72aplQjZSvmSKo.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>---------------------------</span></p><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span>穿越无人区</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnvA9ORZrWFWSgh_FAP8B-Zld8Be.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>---------------------------</span></p><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span>在无人区倒车邂逅温柔景色</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvbzPrktukURiHuZrxNVme1F9vHG.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>---------------------------</span></p><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span>前奏之地狱之路</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnEb94rrN1TWw7YtLd1Y_ee8NDxE.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>---------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：骚骚、王妹儿、子弹</span></p><span></span><p><span>目录：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 边境线路程全程梗概</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">05:40</a> 为了梦想，换了份工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a> 筹备的费用及准备</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="500">08:20</a> 意外频出的开头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">10:20</a> 选择摩托车的来由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">17:50</a> 如何选择一台适合旅程的摩托车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 奥德赛之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 旅途中结识的有趣的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2265">37:45</a> “魔多”之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2745">45:45</a> 最沉醉的景色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3015">50:15</a> 为什么选择在30岁这么做？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3560">59:20</a> 我完全享受在这段旅程中</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkAdp2-sd7CxZPcrBKEiuG0TXBTb.m4a" length="103787461" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:11:33</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FohORhrQuE9jpF23esJ2QLFKvGhx.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.4 怎么去拥有一道彩虹？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64fd9ed53fa4090b74a5ccbf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64fd9ed53fa4090b74a5ccbf</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 10 Sep 2023 10:47:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>怎么去拥有 一道彩虹，</span></p><span></span><p><span>怎么去拥抱 一夏天的风？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期话题：怎么去拥有一道彩虹？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：骚骚、英俊哥、喜兴妹儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>---------------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>目录：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:35</a> 开场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">01:45</a> &nbsp;“我觉得他们说的都是真的”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">02:45</a> “我用彩虹屁PUA了我妈”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> “真正的高手，放屁总是无声无息的”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> “乙方的彩虹屁真香”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="350">05:50</a> “我掉入了彩虹陷阱”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">09:35</a> “但凡夸我的，都是朋友”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a> “香的屁都是有度的”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="920">15:20</a> “善意的而不带目的夸赞才香”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> “如果你是评论的话，那就是一种高级的幽默”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1235">20:35</a> “关于彩虹屁建立的人设”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1340">22:20</a> “关于茶艺的故事”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1490">24:50</a> “你是带着什么样的心态彩虹屁的”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1595">26:35</a> “真诚的赞扬给予人力量”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1825">30:25</a> &nbsp;“我会带着探索的眼光看世界”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> “赞美是更安静的，而彩虹屁更加活泼”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a> “如果它是一门技巧，我们要如何掌握它”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3040">50:40</a> “播客这件事注定是曲高和寡的事情”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3240">54:00</a> “下期不请你了”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3390">56:30</a> “命运会给予有耐心的人馈赠”</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lscGhnYt1iIYghd-Jr_PllFWrEPr.m4a" length="87910504" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:00:36</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FohORhrQuE9jpF23esJ2QLFKvGhx.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.3 当我与时间错过</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64ef72673fa4090b74b86409</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64ef72673fa4090b74b86409</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 30 Aug 2023 16:46:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们时常在想“如果”当时会怎样？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主题：《当我和时间错过》</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：骚骚、英俊哥、颜值姐</span></p><span></span><p><span>---------------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>目录：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="37">00:37</a> 开场介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="142">02:22</a> “关于我选错过做主题这件事”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> &nbsp;“就当他是个老朋友”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> “至少当时我们都用了真心”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="855">14:15</a> “有时候，我想成为别人的错过”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="920">15:20</a> “面对婚姻，我不知该如何选择”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a> “谁说结婚才是正途呢？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> “暗恋这点小事”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">27:30</a> “我学会了拒绝也要体面”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> “学校走廊的花开了，我们可不可以一起拍张照？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a> “经历了逆境才会学会逆商”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3345">55:45</a> “什么叫错过？错不就是在当时没判断准吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">1:00:00</a> “当我和时间错过，本以为我走上了人生的另一条路，殊不知这就是我本该走的那条”</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgHs0xic88yGpAKWPcfgIjFXQwPI.m4a" length="93783162" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:04:39</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FohORhrQuE9jpF23esJ2QLFKvGhx.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.2 去有诗的地方看看</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64d909d6e490c5dee557bc2f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64d909d6e490c5dee557bc2f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 13 Aug 2023 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>世界的风景很美，最好的相机是自己的眼球。</span></p><span></span><p><span>好的旅程不是为了留下来过的证据，是为了记住亲眼所见那一刻的感动与震撼；是你突然意识到生活和时光给了你什么，成长的过程中，你付出了什么。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以，去有诗的地方看看吧，那里有你寻找的真谛。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主题：《去有诗的地方看看》</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：骚骚、王妹儿、大飞</span></p><span></span><p><span>目录：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:35</a> 开场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> “还记得最近的一次旅行吗？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a> “为什么期待旅行？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> “人文还是风景？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> &nbsp;王妹儿：“我去非洲看狮子交配”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> &nbsp;大飞：“我去川西看雪山”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> &nbsp;骚骚：“我在高原喘不过来”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> “我也曾以为我看到了神迹”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> “我在耶路撒冷感受3000年”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1970">32:50</a> “我有个朋友独自骑行去西藏”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> “我对旅行有要求”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> “旅行就像人生，都是妥协的艺术”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3403">56:43</a> 推荐旅行目的地</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljl2-xAijfhUHG89FjrV8POhA2f8.m4a" length="91226015" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:02:53</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FohORhrQuE9jpF23esJ2QLFKvGhx.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.1 亏欠朋友的一声抱歉</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64cae1a799e1e7669eb615f7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64cae1a799e1e7669eb615f7</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 02 Aug 2023 23:07:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>闻人骚嗑是一档插科打诨聊闲天的对话栏目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>每期节目我将邀请一些身边的朋友共同探讨一个看似高深莫测，实则没什么营养的话题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望我们能相遇在你上班途中、下班路上，和无聊的每个转角。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期话题：亏欠朋友的一声抱歉</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：骚骚、大飞、王妹儿</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>“朋友是人生的一件大事。”</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>“情感朋友是上天安排的，利益朋友是你自己可以找到的。”</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>“你犯错了，有人惩罚你不是很好吗？”</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>“来是偶然，去是必然，尽其当然，顺其自然”</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>我们终究是一个背着行囊的旅人，一路会错过很多风景，偶尔停下来也会因为遗失的回忆唉声叹气，但人总要往前走，让我们朝着身后挥一挥手。</span></p><span></span><p><span>接着往前走，别回头。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a> “朋友是人生的一件大事”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="286">04:46</a> “自己犯不犯贱不重要，你怎么看自己最重要”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="758">12:38</a> “精力有限之后，朋友需要分类”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> “不相互苛求，这就挺好”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1219">20:19</a> “听起来挺功利，但这样交朋友效率挺高”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1384">23:04</a> “怎么区分朋友、好朋友、最好的朋友”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1975">32:55</a> “什么原因造成朋友的离去”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2632">43:52</a> “我可以精进我们结束的方式，但结果并不会因此改变”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2950">49:10</a> “我们心肠更硬了？还是我们变得更懦弱了？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3400">56:40</a> “如果道歉是你向前走的途径的话，那就去吧”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">01:00:00</a> “心怀愧疚不是对自己的惩罚吗？做错事有人惩罚你不是挺好吗？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4220">01:10:20</a> “道歉不重要，Move on才重要”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4405">01:13:25</a> “祝愿那些远去的朋友，高卧加餐，长命百岁”</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/loLRT9Zbcy6pCvpxVkTtx8S12WYy.m4a" length="115973407" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:19:57</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FohORhrQuE9jpF23esJ2QLFKvGhx.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
